		(at 102.4 103.81)
		(descr "Pro Micro nRF52840 (nice!nano v2) on two 1x12 headers, 15.24 mm apart, module 18 x 33.02 mm. Geometry of the nice!nano v2 (13 pins per side): the top pin of each side (USB end) is B+ / B- (battery only, no header, no pad here), so pin 1 is 3.81 mm from the USB edge and the last pin 1.27 mm from the antenna edge. No copper between the header rows under the antenna end.")
